Name Belgium Note - Ridders Van Licht HQ #1

Interactability_Text_Line_0 We aren’t accepting anymore people from Belgium to evacuate unless they are Nulirane Researchers or other specified personnel that are permitted for evacuation.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Civilians, law enforcement, military personnel etc are on their own in Belgium until a plan of action is put into place. The Belgian Government and other nations are trying their best to determine a course of action.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 My sincere apologies, General Rayan





